{"id":"1fe18f5339370e3e","group":"62","path":"62/62-thm-Conservativity.md","title":"Conservativity as Equality of Fragment Consequences","display":"thm-Conservativity — Conservativity as Equality of Fragment Consequences","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-thm-Conservativity","aliases":["62-thm-Conservativity"],"display":"thm-Conservativity — Conservativity as Equality of Fragment Consequences","depends_on":["[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]","[[62-df-L2]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition VII.5.12 (definitional consequence)","source_pages":[291,292],"source_pdf_pages":[309,310]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-thm-Conservativity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-thm-Conservativity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-Conservativity — Conservativity as Equality of Fragment Consequences"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition VII.5.12 (definitional consequence)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>291</span><span>292</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>309</span><span>310</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_0,T_1,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}\">\\(T_0,T_1,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>；Cn 与 Conservative 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a>。假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(T_0)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(T_1)\">\\(\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(T_0)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(T_1)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}Conservativity}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{Conservative}_{\\Gamma}(T_1,T_0)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Gamma\\cap\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(T_1)=\\Gamma\\cap\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(T_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}Conservativity}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{Conservative}_{\\Gamma}(T_1,T_0)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Gamma\\cap\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(T_1)=\\Gamma\\cap\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(T_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>展开定义。已假设的可证子理论条件给出从右侧交集到左侧交集的包含；保守性给出反向包含。这个定义推论不是 Simpson 的某个新的保守性定理。若省略可证子理论条件，只有片段交集相等不足以保证本目录采用的 Conservative 谓词。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Definition VII.5.12 (definitional consequence)；纸面页 291, 292；PDF 页 309, 310。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-equivalence-over-base","status":"resolved","id":"781620ab41bfeebd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T_0,T_1,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}$，见 [[62-df-L2]]；Cn 与 Conservative 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。假设 $\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(T_0)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(T_1)$。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-equivalence-over-base","status":"resolved","id":"781620ab41bfeebd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T_0,T_1,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}$，见 [[62-df-L2]]；Cn 与 Conservative 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。假设 $\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(T_0)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(T_1)$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T_0,T_1,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(T_0)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(T_1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}Conservativity}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{Conservative}_{\\Gamma}(T_1,T_0)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Gamma\\cap\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(T_1)=\\Gamma\\cap\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(T_0).","display":true}],"bytes":1437,"backlinks":[{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-86","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-thm-Conservativity|Conservativity as Equality of Fragment Consequences]]"},{"id":"271bc9074a256041","anchor":"ref-337","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[62-thm-Conservativity]]"}],"outgoing":["781620ab41bfeebd","4c6d2d9f1999915f"]}